    "# 03 — Evaluation Suite\n",
    "## How do we know our RAG system is actually working?\n",
    "\n",
    "> **Goal:** Measure 6 failure modes using RAGAS + DeepEval on mock data.\n",
    "> Each experiment isolates **one specific thing** that can go wrong in a RAG pipeline."
   ]
