## 12. Task Definitions

Render the placeholder task definitions and register them.

```bash
export IMAGE_URI="${ECR_URI}:latest"

render() {
  sed \
    -e "s|<IMAGE_NAME>|$IMAGE_URI|g" \
    -e "s|<AWS_REGION>|$AWS_REGION|g" \
    -e "s|<NEON_DB_URL_ARN>|$NEON_DB_URL_ARN|g" \
